.pio/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Course material (02_experimentation.pdf, Peter Thoman, University of Innsbruck) is summarised
# in docs/benchmarking-practices.md and cited there rather than redistributed here.
*.pdf

# Campaign output. Regenerating a 10h campaign is expensive, so keep it — but keep it out of git
# by default: raw.csv runs to hundreds of thousands of rows. Force-add a campaign worth keeping:
#   git add -f results/campaign-YYYYMMDD-HHMMSS
results/

# Generated figures, same reasoning as results/: reproducible from a campaign with
# plot_results.py / plot_comparison.py, so the campaign is the artefact worth keeping, not the PNG.
figures/
